  "title": "APGO評價募集活動",
  "body": "<body>\n\n\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>好評回饋 購物金送給你｜APGO 評價募集活動</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"分享你的真實使用心得,購物金最高 $250 送給你!文字評價 $100、附商品實拍照 $250,立即參加 APGO 好評回饋活動。\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700;900&amp;family=Archivo+Black&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n  :root{\n    --apgo-bg:#FFFFFF;        /* 頁面底色:白 */\n    --apgo-bg-alt:#F7F7F5;    /* 交替區塊底色:淺灰 */\n    --apgo-card:#FFFFFF;      /* 卡片底色 */\n    --apgo-line:#E4E4E1;      /* 邊框線 */\n    --apgo-orange:#FF7A00;    /* APGO 品牌橘 */\n    --apgo-orange-deep:#C95800;\n    --apgo-text:#1B1B1D;      /* 主文字:近黑 */\n    --apgo-muted:#6D6F74;     /* 次要文字 */\n  }\n  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){\n    html{scroll-behavior:auto}\n    .apgo-page *{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}\n  }\n  .apgo-page{\n    font-family:'Noto Sans TC',-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;\n    color:var(--apgo-text);\n    background:var(--apgo-bg);\n    line-height:1.75;\n    font-size:16px;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n  }\n  .apgo-wrap{max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}\n\n  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */\n  .apgo-hero{\n    background:\n      repeating-linear-gradient(115deg, rgba(255,122,0,.05) 0 2px, transparent 2px 140px),\n      radial-gradient(120% 90% at 85% -10%, rgba(255,122,0,.16), transparent 55%),\n      var(--apgo-bg);\n    padding:76px 0 96px;\n    position:relative;\n    overflow:hidden;\n    border-bottom:1px solid var(--apgo-line);\n  }\n  .apgo-hero::after{ /* 底部撕票鋸齒 */\n    content:\"\";\n    position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:-8px;height:16px;\n    background:radial-gradient(circle at 8px 0px, var(--apgo-bg) 8px, transparent 8.5px);\n    background-size:24px 16px;\n    background-repeat:repeat-x;\n    z-index:2;\n  }\n  .apgo-eyebrow{\n    display:inline-block;\n    border:1px solid var(--apgo-orange);\n    color:var(--apgo-orange);\n    border-radius:999px;\n    padding:4px 16px;\n    font-size:13px;\n    font-weight:700;\n    letter-spacing:.18em;\n    margin-bottom:28px;\n  }\n  .apgo-hero h1{\n    font-weight:900;\n    font-size:clamp(36px,6.4vw,62px);\n    line-height:1.25;\n    letter-spacing:.05em;\n  }\n  .apgo-hero h1 .apgo-hl{color:var(--apgo-orange)}\n  .apgo-hero-sub{\n    margin-top:20px;\n    font-size:clamp(15px,2.2vw,18px);\n    color:var(--apgo-muted);\n    max-width:34em;\n  }\n  .apgo-hero-sub strong{\n    color:var(--apgo-orange);\n    font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;\n    font-weight:400;\n    font-size:1.15em;\n    letter-spacing:.02em;\n  }\n  .apgo-cta{\n    display:inline-block;\n    margin-top:36px;\n    background:var(--apgo-orange);\n    color:#FFFFFF;\n    font-weight:900;\n    font-size:17px;\n    letter-spacing:.06em;\n    padding:16px 44px;\n    border-radius:999px;\n    text-decoration:none;\n    box-shadow:0 6px 0 var(--apgo-orange-deep);\n    transition:transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease, filter .15s ease;\n  }\n  .apgo-cta:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 0 var(--apgo-orange-deep);filter:brightness(1.06)}\n  .apgo-cta:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--apgo-text);outline-offset:3px}\n  .apgo-hero-meta{\n    margin-top:24px;\n    font-size:13px;\n    letter-spacing:.08em;\n    color:var(--apgo-muted);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Section 通用 ---------- */\n  .apgo-section{padding:72px 0}\n  .apgo-section-alt{background:var(--apgo-bg-alt)}\n  .apgo-h2{\n    font-weight:900;\n    font-size:clamp(24px,3.6vw,32px);\n    letter-spacing:.08em;\n    text-align:center;\n  }\n  .apgo-h2 .apgo-hl{color:var(--apgo-orange)}\n  .apgo-h2 + .apgo-lead{margin-top:12px;text-align:center;color:var(--apgo-muted);font-size:15px}\n\n  /* ---------- 票券 ---------- */\n  .apgo-tickets{\n    margin-top:48px;\n    display:grid;\n    grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);\n    gap:24px;\n    max-width:680px;\n    margin-left:auto;\n    margin-right:auto;\n  }\n  .apgo-ticket{\n    position:relative;\n    background:var(--apgo-card);\n    border:1.5px solid var(--apgo-line);\n    border-radius:14px;\n    padding:30px 24px 24px;\n    text-align:center;\n  }\n  .apgo-ticket::before,.apgo-ticket::after{ /* 票券左右打孔 */\n    content:\"\";\n    position:absolute;top:50%;width:22px;height:22px;\n    border-radius:50%;\n    background:var(--apgo-bg);\n    border:1.5px solid var(--apgo-line);\n    transform:translateY(-50%);\n  }\n  .apgo-section-alt .apgo-ticket::before,\n  .apgo-section-alt .apgo-ticket::after{background:var(--apgo-bg-alt)}\n  .apgo-ticket::before{left:-12px;border-right-color:transparent}\n  .apgo-ticket::after{right:-12px;border-left-color:transparent}\n  .apgo-ticket-type{\n    font-size:14px;\n    font-weight:700;\n    letter-spacing:.14em;\n    color:var(--apgo-muted);\n  }\n  .apgo-ticket-amount{\n    font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;\n    font-size:clamp(42px,5vw,54px);\n    line-height:1.1;\n    margin:14px 0 6px;\n    color:var(--apgo-text);\n  }\n  .apgo-ticket-amount sup{font-size:.45em;vertical-align:top;top:.4em;position:relative}\n  .apgo-ticket-cond{\n    border-top:1.5px dashed var(--apgo-line);\n    margin-top:18px;\n    padding-top:16px;\n    font-size:14px;\n    color:var(--apgo-muted);\n  }\n  .apgo-ticket-best{\n    border-color:var(--apgo-orange);\n    box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(255,122,0,.18);\n  }\n  .apgo-ticket-best .apgo-ticket-amount{color:var(--apgo-orange)}\n  .apgo-badge{\n    position:absolute;top:-13px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);\n    background:var(--apgo-orange);\n    color:#FFFFFF;\n    font-size:12px;\n    font-weight:900;\n    letter-spacing:.1em;\n    padding:3px 14px;\n    border-radius:999px;\n    white-space:nowrap;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- 步驟 ---------- */\n  .apgo-steps{\n    margin-top:48px;\n    display:grid;\n    grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);\n    gap:20px;\n    counter-reset:step;\n  }\n  .apgo-step{\n    background:var(--apgo-card);\n    border:1.5px solid var(--apgo-line);\n    border-radius:14px;\n    padding:26px 20px;\n  }\n  .apgo-step::before{\n    counter-increment:step;\n    content:counter(step,decimal-leading-zero);\n    font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;\n    font-size:15px;\n    color:var(--apgo-orange);\n    background:rgba(255,122,0,.12);\n    border:1px solid var(--apgo-orange);\n    display:inline-flex;\n    align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n    width:38px;height:38px;\n    border-radius:50%;\n    margin-bottom:14px;\n  }\n  .apgo-step h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px}\n  .apgo-step p{font-size:14px;color:var(--apgo-muted);line-height:1.7}\n\n  /* ---------- 引導三題 ---------- */\n  .apgo-guide{\n    margin-top:40px;\n    background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,122,0,.14), rgba(255,122,0,.05));\n    border:1.5px solid var(--apgo-orange);\n    border-radius:16px;\n    padding:36px 32px;\n  }\n  .apgo-guide h3{\n    font-weight:900;\n    font-size:20px;\n    letter-spacing:.04em;\n    margin-bottom:18px;\n  }\n  .apgo-guide ol{list-style:none}\n  .apgo-guide li{\n    padding:10px 0;\n    border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(255,122,0,.35);\n    font-size:15px;\n  }\n  .apgo-guide li:last-child{border-bottom:none}\n  .apgo-guide li span{\n    color:var(--apgo-orange);\n    font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;\n    margin-right:10px;\n  }\n  .apgo-guide-note{margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--apgo-muted)}\n\n  /* ---------- FAQ ---------- */\n  .apgo-faq{margin-top:44px;max-width:760px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}\n  .apgo-faq details{\n    background:var(--apgo-card);\n    border:1.5px solid var(--apgo-line);\n    border-radius:12px;\n    margin-bottom:12px;\n    overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  .apgo-faq details[open]{border-color:var(--apgo-orange)}\n  .apgo-faq summary{\n    cursor:pointer;\n    padding:18px 22px;\n    font-weight:700;\n    font-size:15px;\n    list-style:none;\n    display:flex;\n    justify-content:space-between;\n    align-items:center;\n    gap:16px;\n  }\n  .apgo-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n  .apgo-faq summary::after{\n    content:\"+\";\n    font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;\n    color:var(--apgo-orange);\n    font-size:18px;\n    flex-shrink:0;\n  }\n  .apgo-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"−\"}\n  .apgo-faq details p{\n    padding:0 22px 18px;\n    font-size:14.5px;\n    color:var(--apgo-muted);\n  }\n  .apgo-faq summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--apgo-orange);outline-offset:-3px;border-radius:12px}\n\n  /* ---------- 活動辦法 ---------- */\n  .apgo-terms{\n    margin-top:44px;\n    max-width:820px;\n    margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\n    font-size:13.5px;\n    color:var(--apgo-muted);\n  }\n  .apgo-terms ol{padding-left:1.4em}\n  .apgo-terms li{margin-bottom:10px}\n\n  /* ---------- 尾端 CTA ---------- */\n  .apgo-footer-cta{\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(90% 120% at 50% 115%, rgba(255,122,0,.16), transparent 60%),\n      var(--apgo-bg);\n    text-align:center;\n    padding:76px 24px 92px;\n    position:relative;\n    border-top:1px solid var(--apgo-line);\n  }\n  .apgo-footer-cta::before{ /* 頂部撕票鋸齒 */\n    content:\"\";\n    position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:-8px;height:16px;\n    background:radial-gradient(circle at 8px 16px, var(--apgo-bg-alt) 8px, transparent 8.5px);\n    background-size:24px 16px;\n    background-repeat:repeat-x;\n  }\n  .apgo-footer-cta h2{\n    font-weight:900;\n    font-size:clamp(22px,3.6vw,30px);\n    letter-spacing:.08em;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- 行動版固定 CTA ---------- */\n  .apgo-sticky{\n    position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;\n    background:rgba(255,255,255,.94);\n    border-top:1px solid var(--apgo-line);\n    padding:10px 16px calc(10px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));\n    display:none;\n    z-index:50;\n    backdrop-filter:blur(8px);\n  }\n  .apgo-sticky .apgo-cta{\n    margin-top:0;width:100%;text-align:center;\n    padding:14px 0;font-size:16px;\n    box-shadow:0 4px 0 var(--apgo-orange-deep);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- RWD ---------- */\n  @media (max-width:820px){\n    .apgo-tickets{grid-template-columns:1fr;max-width:420px}\n    .apgo-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:560px){\n    .apgo-hero{padding:56px 0 80px}\n    .apgo-section{padding:56px 0}\n    .apgo-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n    .apgo-sticky{display:block}\n    .apgo-page{padding-bottom:76px}\n  }\n</style>\n\n\n<div class=\"apgo-page\">\n\n  <!-- ============ 主視覺 ============ -->\n  <header class=\"apgo-hero\">\n    <div class=\"apgo-wrap\">\n      <span class=\"apgo-eyebrow\">APGO 評價募集活動</span>\n      <h1>好評回饋<br><span class=\"apgo-hl\">購物金</span>送給你</h1>\n      <p class=\"apgo-hero-sub\">\n        分享你的真實使用心得——寫幾句話就有 <strong>$100</strong>,\n        再附上商品實拍照,<strong>$250</strong> 購物金直接送給你!\n      </p>\n      <a class=\"apgo-cta\" href=\"https://forms.gle/HN13P2ZNQRNFwEtXA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">立即分享好評 領購物金</a>\n      <p class=\"apgo-hero-meta\">活動期間 即日起 – 2026.12.31｜限 APGO 官網訂單參加</p>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- ============ 回饋票券 ============ -->\n  <section class=\"apgo-section\">\n    <div class=\"apgo-wrap\">\n      <h2 class=\"apgo-h2\">你的心得,<span class=\"apgo-hl\">對我們很重要</span>\n</h2>\n      <p class=\"apgo-lead\">評價越豐富,購物金越多——兩種方式任你選</p>\n      <div class=\"apgo-tickets\">\n        <div class=\"apgo-ticket\">\n          <p class=\"apgo-ticket-type\">✏️ 文字評價</p>\n          <p class=\"apgo-ticket-amount\"><sup>$</sup>100</p>\n          <p class=\"apgo-ticket-cond\">30 字以上真實使用心得</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"apgo-ticket apgo-ticket-best\">\n          <span class=\"apgo-badge\">最高回饋</span>\n          <p class=\"apgo-ticket-type\">📸 圖文評價</p>\n          <p class=\"apgo-ticket-amount\"><sup>$</sup>250</p>\n          <p class=\"apgo-ticket-cond\">心得 + 商品實拍照 3 張以上</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ============ 參加步驟 ============ -->\n  <section class=\"apgo-section apgo-section-alt\">\n    <div class=\"apgo-wrap\">\n      <h2 class=\"apgo-h2\">3 分鐘完成,購物金入袋</h2>\n      <div class=\"apgo-steps\">\n        <div class=\"apgo-step\">\n          <h3>準備訂單編號</h3>\n          <p>到「訂單確認信」或官網會員中心找到你的訂單編號(例如 #1024)。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"apgo-step\">\n          <h3>填寫評價表單</h3>\n          <p>點擊本頁按鈕開啟表單,寫下 30 字以上的使用心得。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"apgo-step\">\n          <h3>上傳商品實拍照</h3>\n          <p>附上 3 張以上實拍照,回饋直接升級 $250(純文字評價也可以參加)。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"apgo-step\">\n          <h3>等待購物金入袋</h3>\n          <p>審核通過後 7–10 個工作天內,購物金折扣碼寄到你的 Email。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"apgo-guide\">\n        <h3>不知道怎麼寫?照這 3 題回答就達標</h3>\n        <ol>\n          <li>\n<span>Q1</span>你最喜歡這個商品的哪一點?</li>\n          <li>\n<span>Q2</span>材質、質地或實際使用起來的感覺如何?</li>\n          <li>\n<span>Q3</span>你會推薦給什麼樣的人?</li>\n        </ol>\n        <p class=\"apgo-guide-note\">※ 請放心寫下真實感受,評分星等不影響購物金發放。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->\n  <section class=\"apgo-section\">\n    <div class=\"apgo-wrap\">\n      <h2 class=\"apgo-h2\">常見問題</h2>\n      <div class=\"apgo-faq\">\n        <details>\n          <summary>哪些訂單可以參加?</summary>\n          <p>活動期間內於 APGO 官網完成、且已實際收到商品的訂單皆可參加。每項商品限評價一次,買越多項、可評越多次、領越多購物金。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>購物金什麼時候拿到?怎麼使用?</summary>\n          <p>評價審核通過後 7–10 個工作天內,購物金將以「折扣碼」形式寄送至你填寫的 Email 信箱,於官網結帳時輸入折扣碼即可折抵,效期 90 天。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>怎麼知道我的評價有沒有通過?</summary>\n          <p>內容符合活動規範者,將直接收到購物金折扣碼通知信;內容不符規範者(如字數不足、翻拍網路圖片、與商品無關等)恕不另行通知。若送出後 10 個工作天內未收到通知信,即代表未通過審核,歡迎調整內容後重新投稿。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>一定要給五顆星才能領購物金嗎?</summary>\n          <p>不用!我們鼓勵真實心得,無論評分星等,只要內容符合條件即可獲得回饋。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>上傳照片時要求登入 Google 帳號,是正常的嗎?</summary>\n          <p>是的,這是 Google 表單檔案上傳功能的限制。若你沒有 Google 帳號,可將照片與訂單編號一併寄至客服信箱【service@apgo.com】,由專人協助登錄。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>我的評價會被用在哪裡?</summary>\n          <p>通過審核的優質評價,將刊登於 APGO 官網商品頁的「顧客好評」區,也可能用於官方社群與行銷素材,刊登時以你填寫的暱稱顯示。</p>\n        </details>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ============ 活動辦法 ============ -->\n  <section class=\"apgo-section apgo-section-alt\">\n    <div class=\"apgo-wrap\">\n      <h2 class=\"apgo-h2\">活動辦法與注意事項</h2>\n      <div class=\"apgo-terms\">\n        <ol>\n          <li>本活動由【APGO 公司完整登記名稱】(下稱「主辦單位」)舉辦,活動期間為 2026/07/07 00:00 至 2026/12/31 23:59(GMT+8)。</li>\n          <li>參加資格:於活動期間內在 APGO 官網完成訂單並實際收到商品之消費者,需填寫正確之訂單編號與會員 Email 以供核對。</li>\n          <li>評價內容須為參加者本人之真實購買與使用心得,照片須為本人拍攝之原創內容。經查有偽造、盜用、灌水或使用 AI 生成不實內容者,主辦單位得取消其資格並收回已發放之回饋。</li>\n          <li>內容授權:參加者於送出評價之同時,即同意無償授權主辦單位於官網商品頁、社群媒體、廣告及其他行銷素材中重製、編輯、公開使用其評價內容(含文字與照片),且不限地域與期間。</li>\n          <li>回饋發放:評價審核通過後 7–10 個工作天內,以一次性折扣碼形式發送至參加者填寫之 Email,折扣碼效期 90 天,逾期失效,不得轉讓、折換現金。若辦理該筆訂單退貨,主辦單位得取消對應之回饋。</li>\n          <li>評價內容未通過審核者,恕不另行通知;參加者得調整內容後重新投稿。</li>\n          <li>每項商品限評價一次並領取一次回饋;同一參加者不得以多重身分重複參加,違者取消資格。</li>\n          <li>主辦單位鼓勵真實評價,評分星等不作為發放回饋之條件;參與本活動之評價刊登時將標註「參與好評募集活動」字樣。</li>\n          <li>主辦單位保留審核、修改、暫停或終止本活動之權利,若有異動將公告於本活動頁。本活動辦法如有未盡事宜,悉依主辦單位相關規定辦理。</li>\n          <li>客服窗口:【客服信箱 / LINE 官方帳號 / 客服電話與服務時間】</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ============ 尾端 CTA ============ -->\n  <footer class=\"apgo-footer-cta\">\n    <h2>別人還在猶豫時,你的<span style=\"color:var(--apgo-orange)\">好評</span>就是答案</h2>\n    <a class=\"apgo-cta\" href=\"https://forms.gle/HN13P2ZNQRNFwEtXA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">立即分享好評 領購物金</a>\n  </footer>\n\n  <!-- ============ 行動版固定 CTA ============ -->\n  <div class=\"apgo-sticky\">\n    <a class=\"apgo-cta\" href=\"https://forms.gle/HN13P2ZNQRNFwEtXA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">分享好評 領 $100–$250 購物金</a>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>",
